			<div class="content" id="post-content-4829392">
									

<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> Tale</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> on november 30th 2020, a breach occurred in the humanoid wing at site 59. “Hammer down” was sent in and at 0537 contained the entity, the resulting casualties were 28 foundation personnel. This however is not the story of “hammer down” it is the story of Alpha-45 “janitors” who have to clean up their mess and end up finding something strange.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> Seasoned alpha-45 squad leader Gilligan has a new member since in the last mission Zachary was taken out of commission due to spilling a barrel of acid onto himself. Henry seems confident about the job being a sanitation specialist in the military. soon finding he has his work cut out for him upon seeing the gruesome scenes within the wing.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Continued&nbsp;</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">hope&nbsp;you&nbsp;are&nbsp;having&nbsp;a&nbsp;good&nbsp;day</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Learning about the foundation and the reality of working there, having to do tasks such as collecting bodies and using a scanner to DNA identify their limbs to make sure all confirmed deaths are accounted for and throwing any loose “Scraps” of flesh and organs into a barrel of acid gil calls the “Stew.”</p>
<p>Gilligan is completely numb to the work he does having been a member of this MTF for 15 years and being a crime scene sanitation specialist for some time before that. Since the foundation doesn’t disclose the info on what caused the mess he likes to play a game he calls “CSI Miami” where he pretends to be an investigator, deducing the cause of death and what could have done it.</p>
<p>After many mop buckets and bottles of bleach they are nearly done when all the bodies have been accounted for and every limb is paired with them. However Henry finds a loose arm under a vending machine that puzzles the two, whose arm is it? Only one way to find out..</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<br />
<strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> A team of janitors are tasked with cleaning up the messes that other MTF cause all the time without consideration.
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Going for a more light hearted tone with the pair in no danger just the amusing interactions they can have in cleaning and seeing the foundation for the first time in its rawest form also going to throw a bit of mysteries in the end.</p>

							</div>

								
					
