<p>That may be true, But the scenario is quite different. His Biological Mother was raped by his Biological Father and left after it was committed. A few months later, The mother confirmed that she was pregnant and decided to keep the child rather than get rid of it.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Try to give your character some type of obstacle.</p>
